  {
    "_comment": "Authoritative Zabbix trigger set for the ATM SNMP templates. scripts/build_zabbix_triggers.py renders these into template_ncr_snmp.xml / template_grg_snmp.xml (a def applies to a template only if its item key exists there, so vendor differences are automatic). Re-run after editing this file OR status_map.json. value: number = literal threshold; {\"map\": k} = code from status_map.json (vendor override aware); {\"expr\": s} = raw right-hand side ({T} = template name). verify_at_walk: assumed SIM-era literal — confirm against the real SNMP walk during cutover."
  },
